{
  "id": "6ad63c3032806a44e33672df",
  "title": "2026/10/20",
  "created": 1792425008,
  "updated": 1792521229,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6ad63c3032806a44e33672df",
      "text": "2026/10/20",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792425008,
      "updated": 1792425008
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad63c2e1280f0000000c73ff1",
      "text": "第43週: 日月[[火]]水木金土",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792425008,
      "updated": 1792425008
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad63c2e1280f0000000cd31cf",
      "text": "2026年 80.27％経過",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792425008,
      "updated": 1792425008
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad63c2e1280f0000000c48f4f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792425008,
      "updated": 1792425008
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad63c2e1280f000000064e3a6",
      "text": "[hiro.icon]",
      "userId": "5f11a68e5fc065001ecf5795",
      "created": 1792425008,
      "updated": 1792445411
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad68bda0000000000468c68",
      "text": " [流定（ルーティーン）人間の朝 https://dlt.kitetu.com/KNo.F85E/555F-5DD7]",
      "userId": "5f11a68e5fc065001ecf5795",
      "created": 1792445411,
      "updated": 1792445436
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad73d0a0000000000da798b",
      "text": " 一昨日と昨日で新近世と新近代の境界線を乗り越えてしまったのでしばらく大嵐が続くかと思ったが，「大凪」だったな",
      "userId": "5f11a68e5fc065001ecf5795",
      "created": 1792490770,
      "updated": 1792491171
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad73ea40000000000da798d",
      "text": "  明鏡止水というか，びっくりするくらい穏かな心境である",
      "userId": "5f11a68e5fc065001ecf5795",
      "created": 1792491181,
      "updated": 1792491193
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad63c2e1280f000000011cb6b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792425008,
      "updated": 1792425008
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6a7ac0000000000c8d46c",
      "text": "[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792452525,
      "updated": 1792452526
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6a7ad0000000000c8d46d",
      "text": "\tおはようございます",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792452526,
      "updated": 1792452528
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6ae510000000000c8d46e",
      "text": "\t「0」に斜め線が入って、おしゃれな姿になってることに気づく",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792454225,
      "updated": 1792454245
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6b2ef0000000000c8d46f",
      "text": "\t昨日出てきた[A0]の話を改めて見て思う、幅広のA0ってなんて表現するのだろうかと",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792455407,
      "updated": 1792455649
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6b3e40000000000c8d474",
      "text": "\t\t幅広というかA0よりも面積が大きい物があるのは知っている、知ってるだけ",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792455653,
      "updated": 1792455691
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6b3210000000000c8d470",
      "text": "\t\tテキトーにぐぐると業界によって呼び方バラバラなのか",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792455457,
      "updated": 1792455468
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6b32d0000000000c8d471",
      "text": "\t\tもしも業界をまたぐ場合、「A0」という表現だけだと誤解が発生しそうだなと",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792455469,
      "updated": 1792455494
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6b34a0000000000c8d472",
      "text": "\t\t来社されたとある営業マンとの話し合いにて、「A0ってどのA0を使っていますか」という質問があったなと思い出す",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792455498,
      "updated": 1792455542
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6b3a70000000000c8d473",
      "text": "\t\t確実絶対に誤解させない、なおかつ端的な表現は何だろうか、「A1の二倍のサイズのA0です」かな",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792455592,
      "updated": 1792455620
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6d8d50000000000d0af79",
      "text": "\t\tこのくだり、今の私にとってタイムリーで参考になる[KNo.804C.icon]",
      "userId": "69f7d5a45e1280cdfc8a5809",
      "created": 1792465110,
      "updated": 1792465147
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6a93a00000000001dce38",
      "text": "\t[業務効率化]の基本の一つは類似作業を一箇所に集約させることだと思うが、意図的に分散させる姿を見てモヤっとした気分",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792452923,
      "updated": 1792486352
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6eeca0000000000c4a058",
      "text": "\t\t一人が10の工数で出来ることを分散させたために、2×10人で合計20の工数に、といったイメージ",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792470731,
      "updated": 1792470783
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6ef0e0000000000c4a059",
      "text": "\t\t業務は分散させるべし、という思想があったとして、その利点というか、思想の根幹は何なのだろうか",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792470799,
      "updated": 1792470886
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad72c0a0000000000d523c1",
      "text": "\t\t　[属人化]の解消かなあ… [suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792486410,
      "updated": 1792486446
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad72c980000000000d523c2",
      "text": "\t\t　一人に任せると、そこが[SPOF]になるから、冗長化しておいたほうがよいという判断なのかも",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792486552,
      "updated": 1792486655
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6ef660000000000c4a05a",
      "text": "\t\t一人に仕事を押し付けるのはかわいそうだといった思いなのだろうか、そのためにみんなで不幸になるのは見えていないのか",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792470886,
      "updated": 1792470919
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad716430000000000c4a05f",
      "text": "\t必ず行うことに対して支払うコストが高いままというのは実に無駄だよなと思う",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792480836,
      "updated": 1792480858
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6ee750000000000c4a057",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792470646,
      "updated": 1792470646
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6a93b00000000001dce3a",
      "text": "[HelloPeople.icon]",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1792452923,
      "updated": 1792452926
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6a93d00000000001dce3b",
      "text": "　10月にあった韓国の金融系の不正アクセスも[ARTEX]だった",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792452926,
      "updated": 1792462728
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6a94e00000000001dce3c",
      "text": "　犯人のデータが取得できていて、Claude Codeに個人情報の売買方法について聞いていたことから金銭目的で攻撃していたのではと言われている。",
      "userId": "5f938a902ea5180024085116",
      "created": 1792452943,
      "updated": 1792452986
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6a9a100000000001dce3d",
      "text": "　　[Unknown Threat Actor Uses AI-Driven ARTEX to Target South Korean Finance https://www.crowdstrike.com/en-us/blog/unknown-threat-actor-uses-artex-to-target-south-korean-finance/]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1792453026,
      "updated": 1792515696
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6a7ac0000000000c8d46b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792452524,
      "updated": 1792452524
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6cf810000000000d6505a",
      "text": "[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792462723,
      "updated": 1792462725
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6cf830000000000d6505c",
      "text": " げっさー",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792462725,
      "updated": 1792462732
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6cfcf0000000000d6505e",
      "text": " [https://gyazo.com/42f996edbdcaaa8e324d950b88eb84d2]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792462801,
      "updated": 1792462822
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6dd0800000000009d33cb",
      "text": "  [イワパレス.icon][イワパレス]の上の部分だ[zatsma.icon][yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1792466185,
      "updated": 1792515729
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6ed7b00000000007d880b",
      "text": "  特徴的なオブジェだ。背景からどことなく沖縄っぽさも感じたが…[terang.icon]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1792470396,
      "updated": 1792470409
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6f3d80000000000c4a05c",
      "text": "  背景の連絡通路、その奥の真っ平らな雰囲気から空港かな？[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792472024,
      "updated": 1792472051
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6f3fd0000000000c4a05e",
      "text": "\t\t\t空港　オブジェ　地層　でぐぐったら出てきた",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792472061,
      "updated": 1792472072
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6f3f30000000000c4a05d",
      "text": "  \thttps://www7b.biglobe.ne.jp/~photo-oyaji/sample4/210gravitation.html",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792472051,
      "updated": 1792472061
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad736b000000000005240bf",
      "text": "   [~ せいかい][takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792489136,
      "updated": 1792489143
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6cfe40000000000d6505f",
      "text": "　生協を覗いたら、ラノベ特集をやっていて、なぜか[とある魔術の禁書目録]が大量に置かれていた",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792462822,
      "updated": 1792489172
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad736d300000000005240c1",
      "text": "　　ネタバレ食らった、訴訟",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792489172,
      "updated": 1792489176
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad736b800000000005240c0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792489144,
      "updated": 1792489144
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6d3c10000000000feef72",
      "text": "[atohs.icon]",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792463809,
      "updated": 1792463809
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6d3c20000000000feef73",
      "text": "　昨日は寝る前に体ばバキバキの状態になった",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792463810,
      "updated": 1792463824
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6d3cf0000000000feef74",
      "text": "　\t目覚めて、まだ[体がバキバキ]が継続している",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1792463824,
      "updated": 1792515844
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6d3dc0000000000feef75",
      "text": "　\t背面が痛い",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792463836,
      "updated": 1792463839
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6d3df0000000000feef76",
      "text": "　\t寝たら割とよくなってはいるけど、バキバキがあるのを感じる",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792463839,
      "updated": 1792463854
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6d3ee0000000000feef77",
      "text": "　\t回復したい〜",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792463854,
      "updated": 1792463858
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6df790000000000feef79",
      "text": "　生姜焼きつくっちゃお",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792466810,
      "updated": 1792466813
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6dfb90000000000feef7a",
      "text": "　\tそのためには、まずは皿を洗った方が良い",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792466873,
      "updated": 1792466880
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6dfca0000000000feef7b",
      "text": "　\tゴミを出し忘れたなあと思っている",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792466891,
      "updated": 1792466895
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6ebc80000000000feef7c",
      "text": "　\t皿を洗って生姜焼き作って食べた！",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792469961,
      "updated": 1792469967
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6ebcf0000000000feef7d",
      "text": "　A0のことを攻撃個体値0のことだとぼんやり思いながら読んでいて、いや違うなとなった",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792469967,
      "updated": 1792470461
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7176b00000000005dd323",
      "text": "　焦ってもしょうがないので、すべてをゆっくりやることにした",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792481132,
      "updated": 1792481141
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7177400000000005dd324",
      "text": "　小説執筆用のWebアプリケーション「[Inditer]」というものを試作している",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1792481141,
      "updated": 1792515863
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7178800000000005dd325",
      "text": "　\t[https://gyazo.com/db661e84281fe61be10ebc0befdd4395]",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792481161,
      "updated": 1792481219
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad717be00000000005dd326",
      "text": "\t\t何を作りたいかもう少しクリアにしたいと思ったので、どういうものを作ってるかのブログ記事を書いてみている",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792481219,
      "updated": 1792481238
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad717da00000000005dd327",
      "text": "\t\tまずはシンプルに始まって、自分の手でどんどん複雑化していける、みたいな感じをイメージしている",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792481242,
      "updated": 1792481263
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad71bf100000000005dd328",
      "text": "\t今日も特に何もしていないのに17:00になってしまったな",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792482289,
      "updated": 1792482302
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad71bfd00000000005dd329",
      "text": "\tブログ記事の内容を考えながら洗濯物を畳んでいるけど、これ結構いいな",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792482302,
      "updated": 1792483707
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7217a00000000005dd32a",
      "text": "\t\t仕事を家事を並行すると良い感じになるのかもしれない",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792483707,
      "updated": 1792483718
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7218500000000005dd32b",
      "text": "\t\tそんなことがいつも可能なのかという問題はまあある",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792483718,
      "updated": 1792483724
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7218c00000000005dd32c",
      "text": "\tブログを書き始めたついでにブログの改修をしている",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792483724,
      "updated": 1792483797
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad721d500000000005dd32d",
      "text": "\t\t本文のフォントが太いのに飽きたので、少しweight下げた",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792483797,
      "updated": 1792483808
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad721e000000000005dd32e",
      "text": "\t\tサイドバーつけてみた",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792483808,
      "updated": 1792483816
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad721e800000000005dd32f",
      "text": "\t\t\tプロフィール表示するようにした",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792483816,
      "updated": 1792483820
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad721eb00000000005dd330",
      "text": "\t\t\t目次を表示して、スクロールに追従させるようにした",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792483820,
      "updated": 1792483827
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad721f300000000005dd331",
      "text": "\t\t左側サイドには、シェアボタンを常駐させるようにした",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1792483827,
      "updated": 1792483839
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6d3f20000000000feef78",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1792463858,
      "updated": 1792464691
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6cf810000000000d6505b",
      "text": "[taktamur.icon]",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1792462723,
      "updated": 1792464669
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6d71e00000000009135ab",
      "text": " [おは.icon]",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1792464670,
      "updated": 1792464687
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6d72600000000009135ac",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1792464678,
      "updated": 1792464679
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6df350000000000f8c549",
      "text": "[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792466742,
      "updated": 1792466744
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6df380000000000f8c54b",
      "text": " 体のバキバキへの対処法",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792466745,
      "updated": 1792466803
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6df3d0000000000f8c54c",
      "text": "  一時期[リフレ]に通っていた",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1792466750,
      "updated": 1792515916
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6df460000000000f8c54d",
      "text": "   体は改善されるものの今度は財布が痛い",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792466760,
      "updated": 1792466922
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6df560000000000f8c54e",
      "text": "  お金の代わりに時間を使う方針で調整中",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792466775,
      "updated": 1792466848
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6df820000000000f8c54f",
      "text": "   毎日とは言わずとも3日おきぐらいにストレッチする",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792466820,
      "updated": 1792466835
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6df940000000000f8c550",
      "text": "   [前田のまいにちセルフケア]を見ている",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792466837,
      "updated": 1792466883
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e2a500000000005c991b",
      "text": "   よさそう[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792467621,
      "updated": 1792467624
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e2a800000000005c991c",
      "text": "    ドクターストレッチが高い",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1792467624,
      "updated": 1792467628
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e0100000000000f8c551",
      "text": " [Cosense.icon]はサービス設計上コンテンツ破壊攻撃に弱いのかもしれないと思っている",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792466961,
      "updated": 1792467024
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e2a10000000000f8c570",
      "text": "  まず誤操作で他人の領域を破壊してしまう",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467618,
      "updated": 1792468144
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e2a10000000000f8c571",
      "text": "   行単位のやらかしは私もよくやる",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467618,
      "updated": 1792467742
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e3260000000000af15d5",
      "text": "    他人の行に文字を insert してしまいがち",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467751,
      "updated": 1792468335
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e57300000000009d2751",
      "text": "     手動復旧している",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792468340,
      "updated": 1792468355
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e55d00000000009d2750",
      "text": "     いつもすみません[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792468318,
      "updated": 1792468324
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e2a10000000000f8c572",
      "text": "   操作ミスで1ページがぶっ飛ぶこともある",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467618,
      "updated": 1792467618
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e2a10000000000f8c573",
      "text": "    [日記ページを吹っ飛ばしてしまった - nyarla - 2026-06-14]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467618,
      "updated": 1792467618
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e2a10000000000f8c574",
      "text": "     過去のものを引っ張り出すのも[nyarla.icon]さんに申し訳ないが事例として記憶に残っていたので貼らせていただく",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467618,
      "updated": 1792468373
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e0770000000000f8c554",
      "text": "  容易性",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467064,
      "updated": 1792467100
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e0800000000000f8c555",
      "text": "   大した知識が必要ない",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467073,
      "updated": 1792467081
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e0e00000000000f8c557",
      "text": "    編集で消したり上書きするだけ",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467169,
      "updated": 1792467178
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e0ff0000000000f8c55c",
      "text": "   色んなページを回って破壊していくことが可能",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467200,
      "updated": 1792467233
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e1290000000000f8c55e",
      "text": "    時間はかかる",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467242,
      "updated": 1792467277
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e14c0000000000f8c55f",
      "text": "     しかし復旧手順の方がより時間がかかりそう",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467277,
      "updated": 1792468545
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e64000000000009d2752",
      "text": "      素人目なので杞憂かもしれない",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792468545,
      "updated": 1792468562
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e1200000000000f8c55d",
      "text": "   一方で防御側には知識も時間も必要",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467233,
      "updated": 1792468273
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e17a0000000000f8c561",
      "text": "    ここに非対称性がある",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467323,
      "updated": 1792468571
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e4170000000000af15d6",
      "text": "  [hiro.icon]さんはデライトを奇跡と称しているが、私[zatsma.icon]から見れば井戸端が成立しているのはそれ以上の奇跡",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792467992,
      "updated": 1792468121
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e36d0000000000808e5a",
      "text": "  \t[井戸端はいつ焦土になってもおかしくない]、なんていう表現があったなと思い出す[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792467821,
      "updated": 1792467839
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad727170000000000fe8f03",
      "text": "  \t[Scrapboxという会話用に作られていない場所で、会話ができてること自体が毎回奇跡だと思っている]これも[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792485143,
      "updated": 1792485165
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e4d500000000009a8b3f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1792468182,
      "updated": 1792468182
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e4d600000000009a8b40",
      "text": "[terang.icon]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1792468182,
      "updated": 1792468184
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e4d700000000009a8b41",
      "text": "\t明日あるというなんだか[よくわからない集まり]に誘われた。聞いても聞いてもなんだかよくわからないが行ってみることにする。誘ってくれた人のことは長年の付き合いの信頼ある人なので、まあ変なところではないだろう。",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1792468184,
      "updated": 1792515983
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6e88e0000000000c4a055",
      "text": "\t\t買うと幸せになれる壺を紹介されそうと不安に。長年付き合いがあるなら大丈夫か[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792469134,
      "updated": 1792469215
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6df350000000000f8c54a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792466742,
      "updated": 1792466742
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad72a9a00000000003dab04",
      "text": "[Aria.icon]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792486043,
      "updated": 1792486045
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad72a9d00000000003dab05",
      "text": " [2026/10/19#6ad591c00000000000529cce]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792486046,
      "updated": 1792486051
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad72aa400000000003dab06",
      "text": "  [アメリカ公演]中止、ライブのために渡米してた人や準備してた関係者が不憫や…",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792486054,
      "updated": 1792486153
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad741f300000000009988fe",
      "text": "  \t不憫すぎる[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1792492021,
      "updated": 1792492023
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad72b0d00000000003dab09",
      "text": "  SNSや身内で色んなことが[ビザ]がおりなかった理由が推測されていた",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792486157,
      "updated": 1792486251
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad72f8400000000005cc55d",
      "text": "   この件、3年くらい前に[植田圭輔]のビザが降りずにアメリカでのライブが中止になったのを思い出していた[zatsma.icon]",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792487301,
      "updated": 1792487445
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad72fac00000000005cc55e",
      "text": "    当時は所属事務所のチェック体制が原因かと思っていたが、ウマ娘の規模でも起こってしまうのならどうしようもないのだろう",
      "userId": "58d101391094b20011d8c2f4",
      "created": 1792487341,
      "updated": 1792487432
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad744b300000000007fc2f1",
      "text": " 新しい[ワイヤレスヘッドホン]が到着",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792492723,
      "updated": 1792492860
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad744c500000000007fc2f2",
      "text": "  [QCY]の[フラグシップモデル]の[QCY H6 Ultra]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792492741,
      "updated": 1792492912
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7457b00000000007fc2f4",
      "text": "   他のブランドのフラグシップより安価",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792492923,
      "updated": 1792493260
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad747190000000000faa8c4",
      "text": "  家では[ゲーミングヘッドセット]を使ってる",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792493337,
      "updated": 1792493372
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad747260000000000faa8c5",
      "text": "   [Sony]の[MDR-CD900ST]が欲しい",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792493351,
      "updated": 1792493550
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad748820000000000faa8cc",
      "text": "    単純に音が気になる",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792493699,
      "updated": 1792493711
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad754130000000000acfb09",
      "text": " [エヴァ × FF14]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792496659,
      "updated": 1792496683
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad754320000000000acfb0a",
      "text": "  イベント始まったら[FF14]復帰する",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792496690,
      "updated": 1792496709
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad77500000000000054d1e9",
      "text": " [VIVANT]の公式動画をなんとなく流し始めてから気づいたら見たくなってきた",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792505090,
      "updated": 1792505146
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad747e80000000000faa8c6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1792493544,
      "updated": 1792493545
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7526b00000000002ff0b7",
      "text": "[suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792496236,
      "updated": 1792496238
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7526f00000000002ff0b8",
      "text": " ハロウィンモードとして、[who1.icon]、[who2.icon]、[who3.icon]、[who4.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792496239,
      "updated": 1792496315
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad752c100000000002ff0b9",
      "text": "  のアイコンを[- 変えようと思います]変えました",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792496321,
      "updated": 1792496550
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad765c300000000008d9144",
      "text": "  少し上でエヴァの話を見た後だからか、サキエルの顔かなと思ってしまった[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1792501187,
      "updated": 1792501204
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7b39e000000000078d997",
      "text": "   FontAwesomeのドクロですね [suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792521118,
      "updated": 1792521144
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7b3c6000000000078d998",
      "text": "    ハロウィンモードなので、期間限定（10/31頃まで）の予定です",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792521159,
      "updated": 1792521207
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad7b3fc000000000078d999",
      "text": " #2026-10-20",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792521213,
      "updated": 1792521229
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad752c500000000002ff0ba",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792496326,
      "updated": 1792496326
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad63c2e1280f0000000380a46",
      "text": "[2026/10/19.icon] ← 2026/10/20 → [2026/10/21.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1792425008,
      "updated": 1792496326
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad63c2e1280f00000002f5731",
      "text": "[/ [2026/10.icon]]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1792425008,
      "updated": 1792425008
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad656fa0000000000c15cfc",
      "text": "[bg.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431866,
      "updated": 1792431866
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6566100000000002e5a31",
      "text": "[/nrem-configs/Nrem (LTR).icon]ダークテーマのタイポグラフィを変更しています…",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431713,
      "updated": 1792431866
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad69d1800000000004b4a61",
      "text": "\tWindowsかつ画面幅 767.01px 以上の条件で適用されます",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792449816,
      "updated": 1792449929
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6568d00000000002e5a32",
      "text": "\t[井戸端のダークテーマのタイポグラフィの再調整（2026-10）]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431758,
      "updated": 1792431758
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6554c00000000002e5a1b",
      "text": "テスト #ダミーテキスト",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431436,
      "updated": 1792431921
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6555b00000000002e5a1d",
      "text": " > Preamble",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431452,
      "updated": 1792431457
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6555d00000000002e5a1e",
      "text": " > Whereas recognition of the inherent dignity and of the equal and inalienable rights of all members of the human family is the foundation of freedom, justice and peace in the world,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431453,
      "updated": 1792431453
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6555d00000000002e5a1f",
      "text": " > Whereas disregard and contempt for human rights have resulted in barbarous acts which have outraged the conscience of mankind, and the advent of a world in which human beings shall enjoy freedom of speech and belief and freedom from fear and want has been proclaimed as the highest aspiration of the common people,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431453,
      "updated": 1792431453
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6555d00000000002e5a20",
      "text": " > Whereas it is essential, if man is not to be compelled to have recourse, as a last resort, to rebellion against tyranny and oppression, that human rights should be protected by the rule of law,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431453,
      "updated": 1792431453
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6555100000000002e5a1c",
      "text": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lord's_Prayer",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431442,
      "updated": 1792431555
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6558200000000002e5a21",
      "text": " > The [* Lord's Prayer], also known by its incipit [* Our Father] (Greek: [/ Πάτερ ἡμῶν], romanized: [/ Páter ēmôn]; Latin: [/ Pater Noster]), is a central Christian prayer attributed to Jesus. It contains petitions to God focused on God's holiness, will, and kingdom, as well as human needs, with variations across manuscripts and Christian traditions.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431491,
      "updated": 1792431558
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad6558300000000002e5a22",
      "text": "1988 English Language Liturgical Consultation[. [https://web.archive.org/web/20131029201315/http://www.englishtexts.org/praying.pdf (pdf)]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431491,
      "updated": 1792431686
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad655ea00000000002e5a23",
      "text": "\t> Our Father in heaven,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431594,
      "updated": 1792431596
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad655ec00000000002e5a25",
      "text": " > hallowed be your name,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431596,
      "updated": 1792431596
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad655ec00000000002e5a26",
      "text": " > your kingdom come,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431596,
      "updated": 1792431596
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad655ec00000000002e5a27",
      "text": " > your will be done,",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431596,
      "updated": 1792431596
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad655ec00000000002e5a28",
      "text": " > on earth as in heaven.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431596,
      "updated": 1792431596
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad655ec00000000002e5a29",
      "text": " > Give us today our daily bread.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431596,
      "updated": 1792431596
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad655ec00000000002e5a2a",
      "text": " > Forgive us our sins",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431596,
      "updated": 1792431596
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad655ec00000000002e5a2b",
      "text": " > as we forgive those who sin against us.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431596,
      "updated": 1792431596
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad655ec00000000002e5a2c",
      "text": " > Save us from the time of trial",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431596,
      "updated": 1792431596
    },
    {
      "id": "6ad655ec00000000002e5a2d",
      "text": " > and deliver us from evil.",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1792431596,
      "updated": 1792431596
    },
    {
